Hello,

I would like to request the addition of support for the Compex
WLE7002E25 device in ath12k. The vendor-provided board-2.bin, which
works with firmware version 1.3.1 but does not work with 1.4.1, is
attached.

Details:

Model: Compex WLE7002E25
Chipset: QCN9274
Tested with firmware: 1.3.1 (working), 1.4.1 (not working)
board-2.bin: attached

I have tested this board-2.bin file, and it works correctly with
firmware 1.3.1, but fails with 1.4.1. It would be helpful to include
it in the repository to ensure compatibility for this device.

Thank you for your time and consideration.

Best regards

